# A fixture is EVIDENCE, not source.
#
# src\transcript\fixtures\ holds one real whisper.cpp run committed exactly as
# the Engine wrote it, systeminfo block and absolute model path and all, because
# the whole point of it is to pin the schema this design bets on (ADR-0001).
# Line-ending normalisation is an EDIT to that evidence. With core.autocrlf on
# and nothing said here, the 2335 bytes the Engine wrote were stored as 2226:
# the blob was not the file anyone was told it was, and the byte count the test
# documents was true only on a machine that happened to convert it back.
#
# It matters beyond tidiness. The truncation case slices this fixture in half,
# so where the cut falls moves with the line endings; and `#load` embeds
# whatever is on disk, so a rewritten checkout tests a different file while
# every name in the suite stays the same.
#
# -text turns conversion off in both directions: what is committed is what is
# checked out is what the Engine wrote. Written for every package's fixtures
# directory rather than for this one file, because the reason is about fixtures
# and not about JSON.
**/fixtures/** -text
